00:36:00,800 --> 00:36:08,640
So when people talk about click stream events here, they have no necessary standard source of truth in their mind of what that means.

366
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:09,440
Is it GA?

367
00:36:09,760 --> 00:36:10,560
Is it Parsley?

368
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:12,000
Is it Adobe, et cetera?

369
00:36:12,160 --> 00:36:13,600
Or is it our internal events?

