00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:22,720
But at Disney Plus, it was the Glimpse events, which everyone then knew to mean these activity tracking events that are used for product analytics, business decisions, et cetera.

371
00:36:23,040 --> 00:36:27,120
And then over here is Dust, which is like our service monitoring events.

