00:36:36,560 --> 00:36:40,160
The reason was that we wanted to have only one integration within the app.

376
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:41,840
We didn't want to rely on third parties.

377
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:45,840
Then it became kind of sticky in terms of GDPR and consent and things like that.

378
00:36:46,160 --> 00:36:54,640
We'd rather just say the data that we're collecting within the app is only going to Disney and then we use that internally in the ways that we define.

379
00:36:55,120 --> 00:37:03,360
But the moment that you add Adobe or GA or anything like that, you've now opened up things like competition in terms of them being able to understand how much your volume is increasing.

380
00:37:03,520 --> 00:37:07,760
People to monitor things and look to find insights about something versus if you're just increasing the volume.

381
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:12,480
Prevention, like even to add a third party processor, like you have to go through the legal.

382
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:14,400
rigor morally internally.

