00:38:25,120 --> 00:38:30,560
Unless you're an expert and you've done it and you know exactly what you want and you know how to set it up very well, quickly and cheaply.

402
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:36,080
But I think the time to it making sense to actually use this stuff is actually much earlier than it's ever been.

403
00:38:36,240 --> 00:38:36,400
Right.

404
00:38:37,120 --> 00:38:45,920
In that case, it was built because of that, but it was also built because of a concern that costs would exponentially increase in a really successful scenario.

405
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:49,280
Even though the bar, I think, was set very low early on.

