00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:58,240
I think the original target was 50 million to 60 million users, but 40 to 60 in three years, and we hit 10 million the first day and 100 million in the first quarter.

407
00:38:58,480 --> 00:39:00,720
But to that point, they also had Adobe as a backup.

408
00:39:01,200 --> 00:39:01,520
plan, right?

409
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:06,000
So let's build it internally, but we've never done this before in this sense at Disney.

