00:39:14,800 --> 00:39:23,840
In the first couple of weeks, we were able to show that the glimpse events that we built were running us around $1,000 a day in total, like end to end cost.

412
00:39:24,160 --> 00:39:27,680
And I think the Adobe was costing us about $33,000 a day.

