00:40:13,200 --> 00:40:16,080
argue that, like, oh, but we should move that internally immediately.

426
00:40:16,240 --> 00:40:17,360
The volume wasn't there at first.

427
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:26,080
But even 33,000 versus 1,000 isn't the actual cost because you have, what, 10 engineers, all in costs of, you know, 400,000.

428
00:40:26,160 --> 00:40:35,200
I mean, if you're paying, if you're paying your resources on your team and things like that, 32,000 dollars a day combined to make those two even, then I'd love to work with you.

429
00:40:35,360 --> 00:40:36,240
Yeah, a lot of that.

