00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:39,520
33,000 dollars a day adds up really quickly.

431
00:40:39,760 --> 00:40:46,800
And then you really can't argue that you're getting any value out of the data, because what on earth in terms of insights would you be producing out of that data?

432
00:40:47,680 --> 00:40:48,720
That would actually be worth it..

433
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:49,120
What is that?

434
00:40:49,200 --> 00:40:50,400
33, that's like millions, right?

435
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:50,560
Yeah.

436
00:40:51,120 --> 00:40:54,160
It was a lot of money if you had just continued with that.

